Z||000014||Seanh||10-14-2000||07:44 PM||||One day this blond was driving out in the country in her convertiable(sp?) and talking on her cell phone. She noticed a blone in a row boat in the middle of a field. She stopped the car and got out to see what was going on. She shouted at the blond asking what she was doing. She replied that she was enjoying the nice day in her boat, but is having some trouble getting anywhere. The blond on "Shore" started yelling and cursing at the blond in the field saying she was the type of blond that gave all blonds a bad name. Before leaving she yell "If I could swim I would come out there and kick your ass".<P>What is the definition of eternity?  Four blonds and a four way stop.<P>There is a Blond, Brunett and a Redhead on top of a burning building. The fire fighters held out a sheet and told them to just one at a time. The Redhead jumped and just before she hit the sheet they yanked it out from under her. SPLAT. They again held the sheet out and told the Brunett to jump. She said no becuase they would let her fall. They replied that they only hated Redheads and they were B****s. She decided she should take her chances and jump. She jumped and they removed the sheet. SPLAT. They yelled at the remaining blond to jump, she shouted no, you will remove the sheet again. They said no, they really like blonds, there so nice and fun loving. She yelled Nope, sorry guys, Im not that stupid, you just put that sheet down and step away from it...<P>Three blonds go into a bar and order three beers. They get them, and say cheers to 3 years. They finished there drink and asked for another. They again said cheers to 3 year and drank. The bar tender asked them whats with cheers to 3 years. They said they just finished a jigsaw puzzle and it only took them 3 years. He said thats nothing to be proud of, they said the box said 6-9 years.<P>No offence meant to any blonds here...<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
